{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415674","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415674","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041567401:1":{"text":"깊은바위 마을 투자 계획안은 잘 봤어요. 거기에 비전이 있다고 생각하세요?","source_cn":"我看到你这次对深岩村进行的投资方案了，你看好那边的发展？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37FCF2EE9D37252","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567402:1":{"text":"그래. 내가 직접 가서 확인했지. 사고가 조금 있긴 하지만, 전망은 꽤 밝더군.","source_cn":"当然，我实地去考察过，尽管遭遇了一些事故，但总体而言前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B509AA6CC355FE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567403:1":{"text":"하지만 모든 지분을 노리고 있는 건 아니네. 그러니... 미스릴 상회도 함께 할 생각이 있는가?","source_cn":"我没想过占据全部的份额，所以秘银商会打算加入吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBFB5EF82029946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567404:1":{"text":"그럴 생각이에요. 하지만 미스릴 상회의 이름으로는 아니죠.","source_cn":"我确实有这个打算，不过不是以秘银商会的名义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDABC0791725ADEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567405:1":{"text":"제 개인 명의로 추진하려고요. 미스릴 상회 전체를 움직이는 건 지금의 저로서는 무리라서요.","source_cn":"应该是我以私人名义先行进入，毕竟我还无法完全影响秘银商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1994855F702AA103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567406:1":{"text":"금빛이삭 마을에 투자할 때처럼 말인가?","source_cn":"就像你对金穗村提供的投资方案一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB60D6623D65AA53D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567407:1":{"text":"지금도 자네의 그 배짱에는 감탄만 나오더군.","source_cn":"我现在还非常惊叹于你当时的胆量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB940EAB779BC344D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567408:1":{"text":"제가 금빛이삭 마을에서 가장 골머리를 앓았던 건 밀 생산량이고, 그 다음은 비즈니스 환경이었어요.","source_cn":"金穗村当时困扰我的最大根源其实是小麦的产量，其次才是营...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204CBF0FA0ECB821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567409:1":{"text":"생산량을 확보하면 나머지는 알아서 잡을 수 있는 문제였거든요.","source_cn":"在确保产量后，后续的环境其实很好处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62BA13BCF7F31359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567410:1":{"text":"사실 그때 현장에서 보고 들은 게 많아서 확실하게 판단할 수 있었죠.","source_cn":"本质上还是因为，当时我正在实地走访，所以一切发展都心中有数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB96CC0472B07A8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567411:1":{"text":"그래서 그렇게 대담한 투자 계획을 세울 수 있었던 거예요.","source_cn":"所以才敢整理出方案进行投资。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE9E5E14C1EDAC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567412:1":{"text":"역시 대담한 결정 뒤에는 확실한 근거가 있기 마련이었군.","source_cn":"果然，无论怎样的大胆，前提都得是自身建立起足够的认知，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E92A808C507B065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567413:1":{"text":"당신도 마찬가지예요. 거상 바엘란이 직접 시장 조사를 나올 거라고 누가 생각이나 했겠어요?","source_cn":"你也一样，很难有人相信奢华的富商巴赫朗会有耐性一个个去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9A6BEAC64B78A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567414:1":{"text":"글쎄, 집에만 있으니 심심해서 바람을 쐬러 나온 것일 수도 있지 않나?","source_cn":"或许我也只是在家待得无聊了，想换换环境呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C3F69166F69526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"바엘란","source":"巴赫朗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}